19-12-19T19:32:16","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9182776212692261,"text_excerpt":"I love this coffee shop! I found them on Yelp when I was in the area! Love my Yelp App! Read good reviews and thought I'd check it out! I love coffee shops too! The owners are so sweet! They work there together. The guy explained about the differences between different types of coffee drinks! You'd think I would know that by now .... lol Anyway, he was patient and very informative . I decided on a vanilla latte which was so good! Perfect pick me up too ... still lots of errands to run! His wife was equally pleasant and I wish I lived closer as I would get more lattes or chinos ( that's cappuccino) ... he explained that to me too! Lol I will be back when I'm in the area to have lunch or a ..."},{"business_id":"iJJYC9k9jtJYU-quIc3Jxg","review_id":"vUcb6KfuqGA_31l1rqj0ag","date":"2021-02-11T20:14:38","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9124515056610107,"text_excerpt":"Not the friendliest place I've been to, but they had Oatmilk latte, and they have a good espresso machine. So 4 stars for the good job you do! The place could use some free Wi-Fi to make the place a little bit more hospitable and welcoming when the staff's attitude is lacking."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"iJJYC9k9jtJYU-quIc3Jxg","photo_id":"YC2IG-J5aeoSPqb5ftq9uQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/YC2IG-J5aeoSPqb5ftq9uQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9780623316764832},{"business_id":"iJJYC9k9jtJYU-quIc3Jxg","photo_id":"WRSYzkREXEYeTDm1V5UQ2A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/WRSYzkREXEYeTDm1V5UQ2A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9780622720718384}]},"notebook_case":null}
